        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "`$toInt: 'abc'` **errors** and aborts the whole pipeline",
            "`$toObjectId` needs a 24-hex string, else it errors",
            "Use `$convert` with `onError` for dirty imported data",
            "Fix the stored type once instead of converting per query"
